# Excluded from the tarball uploaded to EAS Build.
#
# EAS archives from the git repository root, not from mobile/, and honours only the
# root ignore file — the root .gitignore holds a single line, so dependency trees from
# every workspace were being uploaded (mobile/node_modules 343 MB, api/.venv ~150 MB,
# infra/node_modules; ~338 MB compressed). A .easignore in mobile/ is never read.
#
# This file REPLACES .gitignore for EAS, so everything to keep out must be listed here.

# ── Dependency trees: EAS reinstalls from package-lock.json on the builder ──
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.venv/
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── Not needed to build the mobile app ──
api/
agent/
infra/
_bmad/
_bmad-output/
bmalph/
.ralph/
.git/

# ── Build and tooling output ──
.expo/
**/.expo/
cdk.out/
dist/
web-build/
android/
ios/
.cdk.staging/

# ── Local secrets and noise ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.metro-health-check*
.DS_Store
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
